# HumVDetClas: Context-Aware Human Value Violation Detection

This repository now includes a complete, runnable baseline implementation for
detecting and classifying human value violations in app reviews.

Article link:
https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S0957417426020191

## Project structure

- `src/humvdetclas/model.py`: context-aware ensemble baseline
- `src/humvdetclas/cli.py`: command-line interface
- `tests/test_model.py`: focused behavior tests

## Quick start

```bash
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -e ".[dev]"
pytest -q
python -m humvdetclas.cli --review "The app steals my data and shows harmful content to kids." --context "for kids"
```
